          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP673 Nose Hill View [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Easy find near the marker post (which currently has a government “plant pest trap” hanging on it.)&lt;/p&gt;

