        <groundspeak:log id="684181465">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-06T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="265062">nicolo</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP673 - Nose Hill View

N 51° 07.413 W 114° 07.082&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managed to shove my big MOFO cruiser bike into my Jeep and headed to Nose Hill. I think that I need a folding bike like Van der Decken's.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tons of people up here, the parking lots off Shaganappi were bursting, but I managed to find a spot. Mounted my front wheel and took off. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A nice spin to the cap, my knee wouldn't have handled this short stroll but no biggie on my bike. A few snaps and I was on my way to my last unfound Brass Cap in Calgary ...&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
